  "content": [
    {
      "text": "The New Testament (Greek) form of the name Isaiah, as in Luke 4:17 and Acts 8:30. Also an ancient prophet who lived in the days of Abraham and who was blessed by him. He was a bearer of the Melchizedek Priesthood (D&C 84:11–13).",
